# Personal brand work and video production never ship in the public plugin.
# A user's studio (their brand file, renders, ledger, delivery matrix) lives in
# their own project, outside this repo. The Fern & Field example under examples/
# is the one deliberate exception and is NOT ignored.
/motion-brand.md
/style-ledger.md
/delivery-matrix.md
/video-work/

# Per-project runtime state the plugin writes when it runs in a user's project.
.video-direction/
